  "objective": "# External idea (operator-selected)\n\n**Mode:** pure Cursor Ultra-lite (p1)\n**App name:** PitchCue\n**Product dir:** `pitchcue/` (lowercase; never call it `product/`)\n**Delivery remote:** `git@github.com:xy-gty/xy-gty.git`\n**Simulator:** iPhone 17 Pro ONLY (ban iPhone 17 and Pro Max)\n**Feishu delivery tracker:** skip / ignore (负责人自填 deferred)\n\n## Positioning\n\nPaid AI practice coach for instrumentalists. Import sheet/exercise photos, chat warm-up plans, TTS count-ins/coaching, generated drone/metronome beds, optional mic pitch feedback; unlock unlimited practice packs.\n\nPosition as **AI practice coach (＞ tuner)**. Do **NOT** clone TonalEnergy. Do **NOT** clone CuePartner script-timeline UI.\n\n## Core loops\n\n1. Import sheet / exercise photos (Camera + Photos)\n2. Chat warm-up / practice plans with the coach\n3. TTS count-ins and spoken coaching tips (Speech)\n4. Generated drone / metronome beds\n5. Optional mic pitch / rhythm feedback (Microphone)\n6. Unlock unlimited practice packs (paid)\n\nPermission extras must not replace core practice/chat flows.\n\n## Four real permissions (required)\n\n| Key | Use |\n|---|---|\n| NSCameraUsageDescription | Capture sheet music / fingering photos for coaching |\n| NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription | Import existing exercise / sheet photos |\n| NSMicrophoneUsageDescription | Pitch and rhythm feedback from the instrument mic |\n| NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription | Spoken practice goals and coach Q&A |\n\n## Unique UI (hard)\n\n- Circular tuner dial\n- Horizontal practice strip\n- Continuous audio waveform\n- Ban CuePartner-like script timeline clone\n- Ban all-black shell\n\n## Palette (hard)\n\n- Primary: `#7C3AED` violet\n- Secondary: `#F5F3FF` lilac\n- Accent: `#10B981` mint\n- Multi-color, nice-looking; ban all-black\n\n## Branding assets\n\n**Do NOT generate** AppIcon or launch/splash images this round.\n\n## Acceptance / delivery notes\n\n- Ultra-lite Cursor p1\n- Deliver to xy-gty\n- Skip Feishu tracker row\n",
